  "articleBody": "Start a garage-to-ADU conversion by confirming the property’s jurisdiction and existing records, then document the garage, define the living program, develop plans, submit permits, and complete construction and inspections. A coordinated design-build process can help connect layout decisions with plumbing, electrical, code, material, and finish requirements before work begins.",
